  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Grades a single chickpea seed photo into one of four quality classes with a Grad-CAM explanation, lets a reviewer curate multi-view real specimen photos into a labelled manifest with backups and revert, and compares two trained CNN architectures on test-set metrics. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
